<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">To All BBS/IPC<o:p></o:p></span=
></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Cc RAS BBG BBS ASG CTY-AE CCE C=
TS<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Fm ASI<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-family:&quot;Verd=
ana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1F497D"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p=
>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u><span lang=3D"EN-US">Re: Request to load up CKA l=
ane in upcoming weak period<o:p></o:p></span></u></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"color:#1F497D"><o:p=
><span style=3D"text-decoration:none">&nbsp;</span></o:p></span></u></p>
<p><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri=
&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;">Dear all,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Thanks for your great job as al=
ways. Considering the expected AADA slack season is coming, we re-adjust ou=
r policy as below:<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><u><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p><span style=3D"text-dec=
oration:none">&nbsp;</span></o:p></span></u></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:-18.0=
pt;mso-list:l2 level1 lfo2">
<![if !supportLists]><b><span lang=3D"EN-US"><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore=
">1.<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbs=
p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span></span></b><![endif]><b><span lang=3D"EN-US">Australia Trade =
Market Prospect for upcoming Dec<o:p></o:p></span></b></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">According to past years experie=
nce, Australia trade is to step into traditional weak season from early of =
Dec. It=A1=AFs expected market vol<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">will have a big drop in next 2 =
weeks due to impact of X=A1=AF mas holidays at destination. As per customer=
 feedback most Australian
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">agencies will take vacation on =
wk51/52 and resume normal working on or after Jan 3<sup>rd</sup> 2014. As s=
uch, it=A1=AFs supposed our loading
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">PFMC will be not good till end =
of Dec 2013.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-family:&quot;Verd=
ana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black"><img width=3D"482" height=3D"=
289" id=3D"_x0000_i1037" src=3D"cid:image001.png@01CEEABC.5A15C350"><o:p></=
o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-family:&quot;Verd=
ana&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:-18.0=
pt;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo4">
<![if !supportLists]><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-family:Wingdings"><=
span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">l<span style=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New R=
oman&quot;">&nbsp;
</span></span></span><![endif]><span lang=3D"EN-US">HJS loading dropped to =
60% on wk50/51. It=A1=AFs expected this year our loading PMFC will become w=
eak on VVD# CCNP1306E<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:0cm">=
<span lang=3D"EN-US">ETD PUS Dec 5<sup>th</sup> and VVD# HNMJ0006E ETD PUS =
Dec 12<sup>th</sup>.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"margin-left:18.0pt;text-indent:-18.0=
